{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24944","headline":"贡院楼北新栽小松 · 白行简","name":"贡院楼北新栽小松","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"华省春霜曙，楼阴植小松。\n移根依厚地，委质别危峰。\n北户知犹远，东堂幸见容。\n心坚终待鹤，枝嫩未成龙。\n夜影看仍薄，朝岚色渐浓。\n山苗不可荫，孤直俟秦封。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白行简","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24944.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24944","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}